sequenceDiagram
    %% crystalline install on one machine
    actor user as User
    box rgb(235, 245, 255) This machine
        participant cli as crystalline install
        participant config as Harness config
        participant receipt as Install receipt
    end
    user->>cli: run
    loop each harness found
        cli->>config: add the MCP registration
        config-->>cli: written
        cli->>receipt: note this harness
    end
    cli-->>user: restart your harness
